Package: patch
Version: 2.7.1-r0
Description: Tool for applying a patch file
 patch takes a patch file containing a difference listing produced by the
 diff program and applies those differences to one or more original files,
 producing patched versions.
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: GPLv3
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: patch
Depends: libattr1 (>= 2.4.47), update-alternatives-opkg, libc6 (>= 2.21)
Source: http://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/patch/patch-2.7.1.tar.gz file://patch-CVE-2015-1196.patch
